.SS "SystemEx\&.Threading\&.LightThread\&.LightThread (string strName, ThreadPriority prio, int stackSize = \fR0\fP)"

.PP
Creates a new lightweight thread with the specified priority and optional stack size\&. The thread starts in a locked wait state and will not continue until \fBSignal(bool)\fP is called\&. This design avoids the overhead of high-level \&.NET threading constructs and keeps behavior predictable and simple\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIstrName\fP the name 
.br
\fIprio\fP The priority of the underlying thread\&.
.br
\fIstackSize\fP Optional stack size for the thread\&.
.RE
.PP

