.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "void SystemEx\&.Threading\&.LightThread\&.Signal (bool bBroadCast)"

.PP
Resumes the thread from its wait state\&. This method unlocks the internal wait lock and signals the OS-level wait handle, allowing the thread to continue\&. This is the lightweight equivalent of a wake operation, without any of the heavy abstractions found in standard \&.NET threading APIs\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIbBroadCast\fP Indicates whether the signal originated from a broadcast operation\&. 
.RE
.PP

