.SS "bool SystemEx\&.Threading\&.LightThread\&.Wait (ref \fBLightConditionVariable\fP cv, ref \fBILock\fP cvl, \fBTimeOut\fP timeoutMs)"

.PP
Blocks the thread until the associated \fBLightConditionVariable\fP signals it\&. The thread is added to the condition variable's wait queue and temporarily releases the provided lock during the wait period\&. This method provides a minimal and predictable wait mechanism without relying on \&.NET's complex task or monitor systems\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcv\fP The condition variable to wait on\&.
.br
\fIcvl\fP The lock protecting the condition variable\&. It is released before waiting and reacquired afterwards\&. 
.br
\fItimeoutMs\fP 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fRtrue\fP if the logical wait state was successfully reacquired; otherwise \fRfalse\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

